<p>For <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 6, 7, 8, 9</acronym> turns, you put all your will into your blows, adding <acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>Cunning 10, 25, 50, 75, 100,<br>Willpower 10, 25, 50, 75, 100">8, 23, 44, 63, 80</acronym> physical power to each strike.</p><p>The effect will improve with your Cunning and Willpower stats.</p>